{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41453","headline":"题魏坛二首 二 · 李建勳","name":"题魏坛二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一寻遗迹到仙乡，云鹤沈沈思渺茫。\n丹井岁深生草木，芝田春废卧牛羊。\n雨淋残画摧荒壁，鼠引饥虵落坏梁。\n薄暮欲归仍伫立，菖蒲风起水泱泱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}